_4sJqwry1UuleVLdzAqQrTUHloLevttd1EzTg&oe=6AFDCBAE"}, {"file_name": "Oculus_screenshot3_2560x1440.png", "id": "4148866441843497", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75230042_4148866451843496_6682129935359290992_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=8pHJMwcGs4wQ7kNvwEQKGaD&_nc_oc=AdpJb0o3xu4svVottM4tvU6EJzKnR8rL4c433lTfERnqob7_UrE3nPci9tEErvapTxY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSrbIx5Hgadj921NQtDcVR3jQg5A_YRmkuOU1YO5WJRuA&oe=6AFDB6AE"}, {"file_name": "Oculus_screenshot2_2560x1440.png", "id": "485593129259007", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/86615257_485593132592340_9219387823348455694_n.png?_nc_cat=101&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=NuZDbMkxlbkQ7kNvwFKpeF5&_nc_oc=AdraIGJ6RvjT1_fIqLiYfvFCZdE2Lze26Rvc6N-jwEBFdlibsDgDOQ7rqvcU43f7pLc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRHXKkgJRSbSNuaGXUN51qF4JKNfOxiZDa3DU2QZiH-iQ&oe=6AFDE276"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Pool Cubed", "keywords": [], "long_description": "In Pool Cubed, we've exploded the classic pool table into a whole new dimension... and unapologetically twisted it into a first-person-shooter in the process. Now you can literally shoot pool... in VR! This version has two play modes, complete with bar-room ambience. There's a \"classic mode\" for a more familiar experience, and a dual-wielding \"arcade\" mode with a more modern flair. \n\nThis is a sneak-peek at a true one-of-a-kind VR experience that will only get better from here! Give us some feedback on it and check out some of our other experiments at CavemanLabs.com.", "short_description": "If you like to shoot pool, then launch into a whole new dimension where you can actually do just that. It's all in the name... well, except for the guns."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.termsfeed.com/live/b8367e7